  "summary": "ENGINE BUG. Raw calls to functions the engine interfaces lack: SafePolicyGuard.checkAfterExecution(_, false) reverts ExecutionFailed (SafePolicyGuard.sol 239-240); Safe getModulesPaginated with a non-module start reverts GS105 (ModuleManager.sol 204).",
